{
  "type": "subtitle",
  "sections": [
    {
      "startTime": 1.0,
      "endTime": 3.92,
      "content": {
        "en_GB": [
          "Six months after the cataclysm ended"
        ],
        "zh_CN": [
          "灾难结束的六个月后"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "startTime": 4.355,
      "endTime": 8.188,
      "content": {
        "en_GB": [
          "The shattered realm began its fragile recovery"
        ],
        "zh_CN": [
          "这个脆弱的国家逐渐开始复苏"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "startTime": 8.6,
      "endTime": 11.235,
      "content": {
        "en_GB": [
          "To honour the hero who saved the nation"
        ],
        "zh_CN": [
          "为了纪念拯救国家的英雄"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "startTime": 11.863,
      "endTime": 16.556,
      "content": {
        "en_GB": [
          "A grand statue was erected in memory of the Bravant"
        ],
        "zh_CN": [
          "人们为勇者树立了雕塑"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "startTime": 16.966666667,
      "endTime": 19.466666667,
      "content": {
        "en_GB": [
          "Peace seemed to be returning at last"
        ],
        "zh_CN": [
          "一切看起来都在慢慢步入正轨"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "startTime": 19.897636677,
      "endTime": 23.045333333,
      "content": {
        "en_GB": [
          "And life was slowly finding its rhythm"
        ],
        "zh_CN": [
          "回归和平的生活"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "startTime": 23.466666667,
      "endTime": 27.326666667,
      "content": {
        "en_GB": [
          "Yet fate was not ready to show mercy"
        ],
        "zh_CN": [
          "但是命运从不展现仁慈"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "startTime": 27.333333333,
      "endTime": 31.790666667,
      "content": {
        "en_GB": [
          "On that dark day, the spire fell from the heavens"
        ],
        "zh_CN": [
          "在那天，高塔从天坠下"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "startTime": 31.8,
      "endTime": 37.708,
      "content": {
        "en_GB": [
          "A terrifying legion burst forth, beginning a swift and ruthless invasion"
        ],
        "zh_CN": [
          "魔物的军队杀出，侵略由此发起"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "startTime": 38.033333333,
      "endTime": 42.661333333,
      "content": {
        "en_GB": [
          "Within moments, vast lands were lost to darkness"
        ],
        "zh_CN": [
          "仅仅数日，大部分国土已经沦陷"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "startTime": 43.066666667,
      "endTime": 49.545666667,
      "content": {
        "en_GB": [
          "The royal army and elite guard fought desperately to hold the palace"
        ],
        "zh_CN": [
          "皇家军队和亲卫队拼死抵抗，勉强守住皇宫"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "startTime": 49.9933667,
      "endTime": 56.142666667,
      "content": {
        "en_GB": [
          "But against such fury, no one knew how long they could endure"
        ],
        "zh_CN": [
          "但是面对如此攻势，没人知道能坚守多久"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "startTime": 56.566666667,
      "endTime": 62.56,
      "content": {
        "en_GB": [
          "In desperation, the king ordered his guard to flee with the princess"
        ],
        "zh_CN": [
          "绝望的国王让亲卫队尽快护送公主逃离这个国家"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "startTime": 62.866666667,
      "endTime": 66.470666667,
      "content": {
        "en_GB": [
          "But the princess had her own plans..."
        ],
        "zh_CN": [
          "但是公主似乎另有打算…"
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
